WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now I thought I would share
some of my favorite

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
#IfIWonTheLottery stories
from you guys.

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:05.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
This first one's
from @Jerrikaswag.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.408
She says, "I would get Britney
Spears and her backup dancers

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:10.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
to come to my house
and sing 'Work Bitch'

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.579 line:92%
while my kids did their chores."

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:15.081 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:17.283 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.586 line:92%
-This one's from @Kevintjackson.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:23.089
He says, "I would pay Morgan
Freeman to move in with me

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.491 line:92%
and narrate my activities."

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:25.658 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:29.062
"He ordered that pad Thai again
for dinner."

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:32.065 line:92%
This one's from @Kristinrose124.

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:34.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says, "I'd hold
a 'Bachelorette'-style

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
rose ceremony
for every person I know

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:38.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
where they find out
if they made the cut

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:40.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
to be part of
my awesome rich life."

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.442 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:45.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Sorry, Kayla,
you're not getting a rose."

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from @Daveholmestv.
-Yeah!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:51.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He says, "I would finally get
my own HBO Go subscription

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:53.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
and stop using
my ex's password."

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.523 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Small goals.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:59.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This one is from @ewokabby.
-Yeah.

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:02.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She says, "I would pay off
my student loans

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.863 line:92%
and then with the extra $4 left,

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:06.866
I'd buy a bean crunchwrap
supreme from Taco Bell."

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's not bad.

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:12.572
That might be the best one.
-Yeah, that's the best one.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.908 line:92%
-This one's from @wooddr0.

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says,
"I would buy a rocket ship,

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.344 line:92%
fill it with all the mosquitos,

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:20.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
then launch it directly
into the sun."

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:24.384 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Mosquitos.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:26.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
This last one's
from @Chrisorem10.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.988 size:84% position:42%
He says, "I would fly
some people who believe

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.256 line:92%
the Earth is flat to outer space

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
just so I could point at
the Earth

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:32.759 line:92%
and be like, 'Look, dumbass.'"

